This episode is entitled A Night Away, and it is an excellent episode that features James Halpert and his wife, Pamela.

47
00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:12.200
And they are striving to consummate their relationship.

48
00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:21.360
And apparently, there's a young fellow named Dwight Scruti and his best friend, Scott Michael.

49
00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.360
They are running across New York City in this episode.

50
00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:29.700
It seems that Ryan has gotten into a little trouble with the devil's candy.

51
00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:33.720
And by that, I mean that fierce little lady, cocaine.

52
00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.320
Terry, I have a question.

53
00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:38.400
Have you seen this episode?

54
00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:42.180
I haven't seen this episode in particular.

55
00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:44.800
I have seen an episode of this show.

56
